          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Connected and confident care&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">iBed Wireless, available on Stryker’s InTouch Critical Care Bed, is compatible with many information management systems allowing your facility to build a custom end solution. This gives caregivers the ability to help provide advanced fall prevention*, asset management and documentation from the bedside.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Feb 21 2024 15:12:14 GMT+0000",
